00:08:19.699 --> 00:08:21.033
when he shows up on Tuesday,

00:08:21.033 --> 00:08:21.968
it'll look like a Trump

00:08:21.968 --> 00:08:23.669
rally outside that Miami-Dade.

00:08:23.669 --> 00:08:24.604
If you remember the Brooks Brothers

00:08:24.604 --> 00:08:25.905
rally in 2000,

00:08:25.905 --> 00:08:27.874
that'll look like a Boy Scout camp

00:08:27.874 --> 00:08:28.774
compared to what's going to happen.

00:08:28.774 --> 00:08:29.509
And this is

00:08:29.509 --> 00:08:30.142
this to me,

00:08:30.142 --> 00:08:32.078
when constitutional conservatives

00:08:32.078 --> 00:08:33.412
need to stand up,

00:08:33.513 --> 00:08:34.981
at a certain point,

00:08:34.981 --> 00:08:36.048
people have to be

00:08:36.048 --> 00:08:39.051
clear when we have a system of laws.

00:08:39.719 --> 00:08:40.486
There's a reason

00:08:40.486 --> 00:08:41.821
to the special prosecutor.

00:08:41.821 --> 00:08:43.856
This was not the normal.

00:08:43.856 --> 00:08:45.091
Listen, if that's a normal thing,

00:08:45.091 --> 00:08:46.792
it was handled in an inappropriate way.

00:08:46.792 --> 00:08:48.961
They took a very long time to do this.

00:08:48.961 --> 00:08:50.229
And I don't understand

00:08:50.229 --> 00:08:51.898
how you can be a patriot

00:08:51.898 --> 00:08:54.033
and at the same time, stand

00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:55.001
by while people

00:08:55.001 --> 00:08:56.769
are running into the ground.

00:08:56.769 --> 00:08:57.670
Law enforcement

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.772
running it into the ground, our system.

00:09:00.306 --> 00:09:00.806
But but,

00:09:00.806 --> 00:09:02.174
Van, Donald Trump's

00:09:02.174 --> 00:09:03.776
whole political project

00:09:03.776 --> 00:09:06.145
has been to disqualify

00:09:06.846 --> 00:09:09.148
rules, laws, norms and institutions,

00:09:09.148 --> 00:09:10.983
to disqualify the media,

00:09:10.983 --> 00:09:12.652
to disqualify the FBI,

00:09:12.652 --> 00:09:14.820
to disqualify the Justice Department

00:09:14.987 --> 00:09:18.157
for the express purpose of being able

00:09:18.157 --> 00:09:20.159
to make the case when these things come,

00:09:20.159 --> 00:09:21.661
that this is a corrupt system.

00:09:21.661 --> 00:09:23.095
And the question is

00:09:23.095 --> 00:09:24.764
how much takeup will they have?

00:09:24.764 --> 00:09:26.866
I suspect among his base,

00:09:26.866 --> 00:09:27.600
that's going to happen

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:28.634
just minutes,

00:09:28.634 --> 00:09:29.602
at least

00:09:29.635 --> 00:09:30.636
minutes, I guess, after

00:09:30.636 --> 00:09:32.371
this indictment was announced,

00:09:32.371 --> 00:09:34.106
Jim Jordan was already tweeting,

00:09:34.106 --> 00:09:36.242
this is a sad day for America.

00:09:36.275 --> 00:09:37.710
And we'll see what happens tomorrow.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:38.811
But I expect to see

00:09:38.811 --> 00:09:40.446
a lot of House Republicans

00:09:40.446 --> 00:09:42.014
sort of galvanized here

00:09:42.014 --> 00:09:43.616
and attacking the Justice

00:09:43.616 --> 00:09:45.217
Department and why?

00:09:45.217 --> 00:09:46.419
Look, this is espionage,

00:09:46.419 --> 00:09:47.620
potential espionage here.

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:50.122
This is absolutely serious.

00:09:50.389 --> 00:09:51.691
But we can all remember back

00:09:51.691 --> 00:09:53.759
before January six, Steve Bannon telling

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:55.494
the world.

00:09:55.494 --> 00:09:57.296
Hell, will break out on January six.

00:09:58.230 --> 00:09:59.432
I'm not

00:09:59.432 --> 00:10:00.333
convinced that the

00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:02.001
exact same thing is not going to happen

00:10:02.001 --> 00:10:03.536
when all of this becomes public.

00:10:03.536 --> 00:10:04.537
And all of those people

00:10:04.537 --> 00:10:06.872
that were at the Capitol on January 6th

00:10:07.139 --> 00:10:09.442
will all have hell breaking loose,

00:10:09.609 --> 00:10:11.644
whether it is in South Florida

00:10:11.644 --> 00:10:14.580
or Washington, D.C., ten times more.

00:10:15.114 --> 00:10:16.382
I know it may not be sufficient

00:10:16.382 --> 00:10:17.149
for many, but, you know,

00:10:17.149 --> 00:10:18.451
I understand that

00:10:18.618 --> 00:10:20.686
the former president also has limits.

00:10:21.087 --> 00:10:23.089
The public doesn't seem to

00:10:23.089 --> 00:10:24.056
recognize that.

00:10:24.056 --> 00:10:25.791
But he will obey process.

00:10:25.791 --> 00:10:27.793
He will appear at 3 p.m.

00:10:27.793 --> 00:10:30.096
in Miami courthouse to answer

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.698
the federal charges next week.

00:10:32.698 --> 00:10:34.300
He's not ignoring the process.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:36.068
He didn't ignore the process

00:10:36.068 --> 00:10:37.403
before the Manhattan DA's office.

00:10:37.403 --> 00:10:39.972
He has the right to dispute the

00:10:40.406 --> 00:10:42.174
the merits of a prosecution,

00:10:42.174 --> 00:10:43.809
which he is fully going to do.

00:10:43.809 --> 00:10:45.144
Is he going to take advantage

00:10:45.144 --> 00:10:47.146
of the political process? You bet.

00:10:47.146 --> 00:10:48.714
And you would expect him to do so.

00:10:48.714 --> 00:10:50.049
I don't think the country

00:10:50.049 --> 00:10:50.616
is going to fall

00:10:50.616 --> 00:10:51.651
to pieces

00:10:51.651 --> 00:10:53.386
as a result of the fact that he is going

00:10:53.386 --> 00:10:54.820
to contest these charges.

